  "question": {
    "text": "An average force of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>125</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>&nbsp;is applied on a machine gun firing bullets each of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> at the speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>250</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> to keep it in position. The number of bullets fired per second by the machine gun is :",
