  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The formula to calculate the net momentum of the gun and bullet system can be written as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Substitute the values of the known parameters into equation (1) and solve to calculate the required number of bullets.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnspacing=\"0px\" columnalign=\"right center left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>125</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>n</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>1000</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>250</mn><mo>)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>",
